~ start
do province_wait()
Max: They... still didn't come with me.
Max: Why... WHY?
Tito Elpa: Max? What are you doing here?
do add_tito()
Max: Tito Elpa...
Max: I... brought my parents some pasalubong...
Max: I... thought I could finally give back to them now.
Tito Elpa: Give back to them? You can always leave things in th-
Tito Elpa: Wait... That camera.
Tito Elpa: You got that from my wife.
Max: ...
Max: So you know what it does?
Tito Elpa: ...Yes.
Max: ...
Tito Elpa: Max, you can only so much as live in the past.
Tito Elpa: It's futile to try to interact with it.
Tito Elpa: No matter how much the present bleeds into the past,
Tito Elpa: And no matter how much the past bleeds into our present,
Tito Elpa: We can do nothing but look back in our experiences set in stone by time.
Max: ...
Max: So there's no way for me to see them in person.
Max: And there's no way for them to receive my pasalubong.
Tito Elpa: They would want you to explore the world, Max. To capture all kinds of sights. 
Tito Elpa: They wouldn’t want your camera trapped in the past.
Max: Then, what am I supposed to do...
Tito Elpa: If you want to give your pasalubong to them so badly, go visit them. 
Tito Elpa: They've been patiently waiting for you this entire time.
Tito Elpa: You've just been too scared to face them for so long..
Max: ...
Max: Thank you, Tito Elpa. 
Max: I'll pick up my things and visit them myself
Tito Elpa: Alright, I'll get going then.
Tito Elpa: Best of luck to you, Max.
do kill_tito()
do PlayerStats.continue_scene() #scene_progress at 6 now
=> END